              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Instead of making these \"to go,\" I scaled the recipe to 2 servings as a snack for my preschooler and me. She had trouble getting the cream from the bottom of the cup and in the end had cream leftover. I think there is enough mixture that you could make 2 layers of fruit and cream, and that would help incorporate throughout the cup. These were tasty and fun; thanks for the idea!",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-19T21:29:36.527Z"
          },
          {
