            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "patti"
            },
            "reviewBody": "made this for a womens book group, and it was wonderful! everyone wanted the recipe. My only advice is that after a while the cookies can get soggy and it is much better with crisp cookies. Put them together at the last minute.",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-29T06:46:02.713Z"
          },
          {
